                            4
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَهْلَكَهُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He destroyed, made an end of,</i> or
<i>caused to perish</i> or <i>come to an end, made away,
did away with,</i> or <i>brought to nought, him,</i> or <i>it;
took away his life.</i>
